     PSS.upd (PSIU.ps_of pv pe ce E1 bm bd stack buf) (uv E' (PB4.pv_st lv)) (uv E' (PB4.pv_sst lv)) (uv E' (PB4.pv_nst lv)) bm' bd' (uv E1 ce) (uv E1 pe) bufm (PB4.win_of (uv E' (PB4.pv_wptr lv)) wend)).
